Package: xpm
Version: 2.0-0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), wget, dpkg, tar, gzip
Recommends: gpg, mono-runtime | dotnet-runtime-8.0
Maintainer: Zizhao <zizhao@example.com>
Description: XPM - X11 Package Manager (Petroleum Edition)
 A complete, apt-free package management system.
 Features:
  - Zero apt-get / apt-cache usage (wget + dpkg only)
  - Full dependency resolution (OR, version constraints, topological sort)
  - Transaction rollback support
  - GPG signature verification
  - Dual-format source (Debian-compatible + native [xpm] format)
  - xm-build: build .oil packages from directories
  - Complete test suite (36 tests)
  - Multi-language UI (en/zh/ja)
  - Coffee machine crash counter
  - Oil-driven resource metering (100001%)
  - C# backend available (xmcs)
 Homepage: https://github.com/zizhao114514/xpm
